			"notes": "# Gliders v1.1.8 – Minecraft 1.21.1\n\n### ✨ What's New\n\n- 🧙 **Enchanting Restored**\n    - Gliders can once again be enchanted in survival mode.  \n      _(Closes [#105](https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/issues/105))_\n\n- 🏷️ **Improved Tagging**\n    - Added a dedicated item tag for Gliders to reduce repetitive tags across mods.\n    - This tag has been integrated into various accessory mods for better compatibility.\n\n- 🔁 **Simplified Swap Logic**\n    - Streamlined glider item swap behavior with armor pieces.  \n      _(Closes [#99](https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/issues/99))_\n\n### 🧰 Maintenance\n\n- ❌ **Removed Palladium Core**\n    - No longer a dependency.\n\n- 🔧 **Fixes**\n    - Corrected access transformer remapping issues.\n\nHappy gliding! 🪁\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Update LevelRendererMixin.java - Parity with Forge by @snoandpetals in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/57\n* Port to 1.21.1 by @cassiancc in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/94\n* Further porting fixes by @cassiancc in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/95\n* Remove Palladium Core by @cassiancc in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/106\n* Various glider item fixes by @cassiancc in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/107\n* Re-enable data generation by @cassiancc in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/108\n\n## New Contributors\n* @snoandpetals made their first contribution in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/57\n* @cassiancc made their first contribution in https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/pull/94\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Jeryn99/Gliders/compare/v1.19.2-1.1.2...v1.21.1-1.1.8"
		},
